    "VM view data preserves actual ordinary uncatchable and private termination completions",
    "VM view data borrows without keeping the actual view or native backing alive",
    "VM view data observes unmanaged external storage without adding a lease or changing cleanup",
    "VM view data follows real ArrayBuffer transfer detachment and the receiving physical storage"
